          "thread": "Stablecoin infrastructure buildout",
          "why": "Multiple top-tier headlines — PYUSDx, RLUSD partnership, virtual accounts, zero-fee agent onramps — show readers tracking MoonPay's deliberate move from fiat-onramp to stablecoin plumbing layer."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "TradFi co-branding partnerships",
          "why": "PayPal, Mastercard, Uniswap, Robinhood, and Paysafe integrations drew sustained clicks because readers interpret each TradFi name-drop as incremental legitimacy and distribution scale."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "AI agent payments stack",
          "why": "A cluster of AI-agent headlines — MoonAgents Card, Ledger-secured agents, zero-fee stablecoin rails, ChatGPT App Store — signals readers are watching whether MoonPay can own the autonomous-finance settlement layer."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Acquisition-led expansion",
          "why": "The $175M Helio deal and DFlow acquisition generated outsized curiosity because they showed MoonPay buying strategic capabilities rather than just signing integration agreements."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Emergency liquidity and demand spikes",
          "why": "The Galaxy/Ripple $160M lifeline story resonated because it exposed the fragility beneath the growth narrative — a single memecoin event overwhelming onramp capacity and triggering a rapid capital raise."
        }
      ]
